  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banana Production Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Banana production and marketing, Beneficiaries: 84 (25 women), The project will allow the GIE Cafoo Nin Fansoto to improve its financial and administrative management capacity and relaunch banana production activities. It will be an important source of income for 4 villages of the Boudi, an area which suffered much from the rebellion. It will also be a contribution in GOS efforts to promote banana production to reduce importations.</narrative>
  </description>
